# Rust style (Hexplace)

When editing `*.rs`, follow [`.agents/skills/style-guide-rust`](../skills/style-guide-rust/SKILL.md).

Hard limits:

- Max line length **100** (matches `rustfmt.toml`)
- Max file length **~500** lines; split before landing if near ~450
- Prefer `#[expect(...)]` over `#[allow(...)]`
- Prefer early returns / `let-else`
- Public modules: `//!` docs; `///` before attributes

Do not drive-by reformat or refactor unrelated code. An `afterFileEdit` hook may run `rustfmt` on edited Rust files.
